    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "美琴！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020020,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "……！\r\n……びっくりした",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "3000250030",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すまん、驚かせて\r\n気が付かないようだったから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020030,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "ううん、大丈夫\r\n来てたの、本当に気が付かなかった",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さっき、\r\n電話もしたんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020040,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "そうだったの？\r\nごめんね、ずっとスマホ見ていなかったから",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……美琴、\r\n今日は何時頃から練習してたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020050,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "え？　んー……\r\n今日は昼過ぎからしかレッスン室が空いていなくて",
    "charAnim1": "think2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020060,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "だからそれくらいに来たの",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さっき、帰ろうとしたら\r\nまだレッスン室の明かりが点いてたから驚いてさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それで寄ったんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020070,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "…………？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1_s",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "美琴、ほとんど毎日深夜まで……\r\nいや、明け方くらいまで練習してる日もあるだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020080,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "うん、……もしかしてここのレッスン室\r\n夜は閉めないといけなかった？",
    "charAnim1": "think1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020090,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "それなら別に、練習できるスタジオ\r\n探さないといけないか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいや、そういうことじゃなくて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020100,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "……？\r\nじゃあ、使っていてもいいの？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それは、構わないんだけどさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "美琴はトレーナーさんからも\r\n指摘するところが無いっていつも言われてるだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ダンスも歌も、覚えるのが早いし\r\n正直、今すぐにステージに立っても問題無いくらいだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020110,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1_s",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "練習熱心なのは良いことだし、\r\nもっと上手くなりたいっていう姿勢は素晴らしいと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、焦ったり無理したりしなくても\r\n美琴は充分──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020120,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "昨日できたことが、\r\n今日絶対にできるとは限らない",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020130,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "だから、毎日、毎日\r\n同じように練習するの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020140,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "それが本当に、できるってことだと思うから",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………だけど、\r\nたまにはちゃんと休んでほしいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "プロデューサーとしてはさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1_s",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020150,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "──10年間、ずっとこうしてきたのに？",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020160,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "前の事務所にいた時は、毎日こうしてた\r\n周りの子たちも、みんな",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020170,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "そのくらい、難しくて\r\n切実な夢だと思うから",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020180,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "自分のなりたい、アイドルになるってことは",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "………………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020190,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "心配しなくても大丈夫\r\n体調管理には気をつけてる",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020200,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "それに、私……",
    "charAnim1": "think1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020210,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "歌とか、ダンスとか……パフォーマンスで\r\nみんなに感動を与えるようなアイドルになりたいから",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020220,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "……そうなれるなら、死んだっていいの",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020220"
  },
  {
    "select": "……わかった",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "……ダメだよ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "……仕方ないな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そこまで言うなら\r\nまずは美琴が思うように、やってみてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ただし体調管理には\r\n今まで以上に気をつけること！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020230,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "……うん、わかってる\r\nありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020240,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "２８３プロって、良い事務所だね\r\n少し、優しすぎるけど",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020240"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなふうに言ったら\r\nきっと美琴のファンが悲しむ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "美琴だって、応援してくれてる人を\r\n悲しませるのは本意じゃないだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020250,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "そうだね\r\nそれは一番したくないことだから、どうしよう",
    "charAnim1": "think2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020250"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1_s",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020260,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "……困っちゃうな",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020260"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルのスケジュール管理も\r\n体調管理も、プロデューサーの仕事でもあるからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "美琴が無理しすぎないように、それで\r\n毎日納得いくまで練習できるように、考えてみるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020270,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "……本当？\r\n嬉しい、ありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025001020280,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "それなら、もっと頑張らないとね\r\n……私には、これしかないんだから",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close5",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500102/1025001020280"
  },
